==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*loodak}}, from {{inh|fi|urj-pro|*loŋe-||to throw, push away}}. Probably related to {{cog|myv|лиемс||to prepare yarn for weaving}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fi-pronunciation|luoDa*}}

===Verb===
{{fi-verb}}
{{tlb|fi|transitive}}

# to [[create]] {{gloss|bring into existence out of nothing}}
#* {{RQ:fi:KR38|Genesis|1:1|passage=Alussa '''loi''' Jumala taivaan ja maan.|t=In the beginning God '''created''' the heaven and the earth.}}
# to [[create]], [[make]] {{gloss|produce out of something else; devise art, etc.}}
# to [[shovel]] {{gloss|move with a shovel}}
#: {{syn|fi|lapioida}}
#: {{coi|fi|'''luoda''' lunta|to '''shovel''' snow}}
# to [[shed]] {{gloss|radiate, cast, give off light}}
#: {{coi|fi|'''luoda''' katseensa|to '''set''' eyes on|q=+ illative}}
#: {{ux|fi|Lamppu '''luo''' sinistä valoa.|The lamp '''sheds''' blue light.}}
# to [[shed]], [[moult]]/[[molt]], [[exuviate]], [[slough]] {{gloss|cast off a covering, especially a skin}} {{q|usually with an object to distinguish from other meanings}}
#: {{ux|fi|Käärme alkoi '''luoda''' nahkaansa.|The snake began to '''moult'''.}}
#: {{ux|fi|Kun hummeri kasvaa, se '''luo''' kuorensa.|As it grows, a lobster will '''exuviate'''.}}
# {{lb|fi|of animals}} to [[give]] [[birth]] [[prematurely]] {{q|usually with an object to distinguish from other meanings}}
#: {{uxi|fi|tamma '''loi''' varsan|the mare '''foaled prematurely'''}}
# {{lb|fi|weaving}} to [[warp]] {{gloss|arrange so that they run lengthwise in weaving}}
# {{lb|fi|archaic}} to [[begin]], [[start]] to {{+obj|fi|inf3 ill<to do>}}
